DESCRIPTION:[Podcast: This Week in Virology]\n\nPaul Bieniasz joins TWiV t
 o discuss his lab&#8217\;s discovery that the coronavirus nuclease NSP15 c
 uts viral RNA into oligonucleotides that are reinserted elsewhere in the v
 iral RNA\, generating insertion mutations at a frequency above 10⁻³ per
  genome\, including new furin cleavage sites at the spike S1/S2 junction. 
 Hosts:&nbsp\; Vincent Racaniello \, Alan Dove \, and Kathy Spindler Click 
