DESCRIPTION:[Podcast: This Week in Virology]\n\nRoberto Cattaneo and Kalpa
 na Yadav join TWiV at the 2026 meeting of the American Society for Virolog
 y to discuss how the absence of measles virus receptors in the brain selec
 ts for hyperfusogenic variants that spread neuron-to-neuron and cause suba
 cute sclerosing panencephalitis\, a rare but fatal long-term neurological 
