 er 14: Origins of Elements Alan &#8211\; Redshirts \, by John Scalzi Vince
 nt &#8211\; Prone to Bruise by David Molesky he’s at Spring/Break till 9
 /28 Listener Pick Anne &#8211\; Nikon Small World in Motion Competition In
 tro music is by&nbsp\; Ronald Jenkees Send your virology questions and com
 ments to twiv@microbe.tv Content in this podcast should not be construed a
 s medical advice. The post TWiV 1361: Ancient Viral Sword and Shield first
